>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
*> Primorials up to 1e6, including 1; expect 8.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PRIMORIAL-NUMBERS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-COUNT   PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-P       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-N       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-D       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-Q       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-R       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-PRIME   PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-ACC PIC 9(12) VALUE 1.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING WS-P FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL WS-ACC * WS-P > 1000000
        MOVE WS-P TO WS-N
        PERFORM CHECK-PRIME
        IF WS-PRIME = 1
            COMPUTE WS-ACC = WS-ACC * WS-P
            ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY WS-COUNT
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-PRIME.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-PRIME
    IF WS-N < 2 MOVE 0 TO WS-PRIME END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING WS-D FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL WS-D * WS-D > WS-N OR WS-PRIME = 0
        DIVIDE WS-N BY WS-D GIVING WS-Q REMAINDER WS-R
        IF WS-R = 0 MOVE 0 TO WS-PRIME END-IF
    END-PERFORM.
